{
  "id": "dialogue.mamimi.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "街边的她",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 2,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mamimi.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mamimi.first",
    "idolId": "mamimi",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "283 Production……这也太突然了吧ー？你是认真的吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我看了一眼，就觉得你有素质──",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "要不要和我一起，以顶级偶像为目标？我想你能看到新的世界！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……唔，可是偶像啊，每天放学后都要练习吧ー？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "那不是很麻烦吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那个……你是学生吗？大学生？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "不是ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶！？那……高中生？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "是啊，看不出来吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "看不出来……不对，那不重要。这个时间一个人在外面，很危险吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "我一直都这样啊……而且话说，挖人的哥哥你才更可疑吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "算了，话说完了吧？我要走了。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，等一下！",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……还有什么事吗？偶像我不当哦ー。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是那个。这个时间把你一个人放着，我做不到。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "…………哥哥，你还真奇怪呢ー。"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（让我去挖苗子……今天也没遇到合适的。）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（已经这个时间了，差不多该回去了──）",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（嗯？那孩子穿得挺有派头……气质很特别，也很漂亮。）",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（──只能上去搭话了！）",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不好意思，能打扰一下吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……有什么事吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我在艺能事务所做制作人……啊，这是我的名片。方便的话请收下。",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "其实，我想挖你。要不要来我们事务所当偶像？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
